Cannot set device flag settings: Invalid argument

I found a way to make thing work and don't work by one command.
# rmmod bonding
# ifdown br14
# ifdown br15
# ifup --force bond0
# ifup --force bond0.15
# ifup --force br15
=3D> i can ping my ip on 15 working
